Hypothesis Hc : 1 <= c <= 31.
Hypothesis Hn : nth_error (r_st (pr Σ c)) i = Some (CkAlloc n).
Hypothesis Hn1 : 1 <= n.
Hypothesis Hsp : l_ACEIL (lay Σ) + 0x10000 <= usp.
